@startuml
title Activity target — Java commits, Python computes, human approves
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
|Operator / Thymeleaf|
start
:Choose type / upload;
|Java services|
if (Auth/file/profile valid?) then (yes)
:Commit original metadata;\ncreate durable QUEUED job, pin manifest;
|Java runner|
:Claim short DB transaction;\nprivate HTTP outside transaction;
|Python ai-service|
:Admission slot / resource bounds;
:Canonical render / OCR / extraction;\nnormalization / evidence / attempt artifacts;
|Java runner|
if (Valid response/assets and current fence?) then (yes)
:Commit immutable run;\nhead-null guard => draft, otherwise candidate;
|Operator / Thymeleaf|
:Select/adopt candidate if intended;
repeat
:Compare source / edit fields/items / save;
|Java services|
:Revalidate head/version;\nappend revision + CAS;
|Operator / Thymeleaf|
repeat while (Issues/conflict need correction?) is (yes) not (no)
:Confirm review / acknowledge warnings;
|Java services|
if (Current head + approval guards pass?) then (yes)
:Record approval + version CAS + audit;
:Export explicit approved revision;\ndeterministic bytes/hash;
|Operator / Thymeleaf|
:Download approved JSON;
stop
else (no)
:409/422; preserve user edits;\nretry review deliberately;
stop
endif
else (no)
:Bounded transient retry or typed fail;\nstale/cancelled attempt cannot commit;
stop
endif
else (no)
:Reject actionable error;
stop
endif
@enduml
